    ],
    "text": "For the sea areas extending from Mullaittivu to Chilaw via Kankasanthurai, Mannar and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota PLEASE BE PREPARED! The sea areas extending from Mullaittivu to Chilaw via Kankasanthurai and Mannar, and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be very rough at times with strong gusty winds up to (60-65) kmph. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard.",
